Read and enforce `docs/governance/projects/shift-agent.md`.

Hermes owns absence-intent detection and message wording. Deterministic code
owns employee identity, eligibility, proposal state, approval codes and send
eligibility. Routing belongs to the shared `dispatch_shift_agent` matrix, not
to a handler skill.

`src/agents/shift/scripts/`, `src/agents/shift/systemd/` and the dispatcher
skill are SHARED PLATFORM, not this product.
